# NSLS Claude Code Marketplace

This is the NSLS curated plugin marketplace for Claude Code.

## Included plugins

| Plugin | Source | Description |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| [superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers) | obra/superpowers | TDD, debugging, collaboration patterns |
| [compound-engineering](https://github.com/EveryInc/compound-engineering-plugin) | EveryInc/compound-engineering-plugin | 29 agents, 22 commands, 19 skills |
| [coding-tutor](https://github.com/EveryInc/compound-engineering-plugin) | EveryInc/compound-engineering-plugin | Personalized coding tutorials with spaced repetition |

> **Note:** `compound-engineering` and `coding-tutor` come from the `EveryInc/compound-engineering-plugin` marketplace,
> which is configured as a separate marketplace source alongside this repo.

## Adding new plugins

1. Add an entry to `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`
2. Commit and push — org members pick it up on next sync

## Org settings.json

Administrators: add this to the org-level `settings.json`:

```json
{
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "nsls": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "thensls/claude-marketplace"
      }
    },
    "compound-engineering": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "EveryInc/compound-engineering-plugin"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
